<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Amari Ngone Sobel Fall</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Amari Ngone Sobel Fall was a ruler of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cayor">Cayor</a>, a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wolof">Wolof</a> state that had been a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vassal">vassal</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jolof-empire">Jolof Empire</a>. Around 1549 his forces defeated the imperial army at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-danki">Battle of Danki</a>. The victory effectively ended Jolof's dominance over the other Wolof states, which then became independent kingdoms.</p></div>
